{#
  The barème, folded away.

  It answers two questions a unit only has to settle once: which of its own
  Desk tariffs means "couple", and what one person on each tariff costs. The
  first is pre-filled by Modules\Fees\Service\FeeCategoryClassifier, so a
  unit whose wording is ordinary never opens this. The second exists only to
  turn a discrepancy into euros — nothing is computed from it and no screen
  presents it as an amount owed.

  « Chercher les montants » (Modules\Fees\Service\FederalScaleLookupService)
  reads the federation's own page and PROPOSES the three amounts. It is a
  second submit button on this same form rather than a nested form, which
  HTML does not allow — `formaction` sends it elsewhere and the CSRF token
  above is the same one. It is rendered only while `scale_lookup_available`
  is true, i.e. while the llm_connector module is enabled AND has a model on
  the cheap tier (ARCHITECTURE.md §7.5): with no AI, this block is exactly
  what it always was.

  Nothing about a proposal is saved. `scale_suggestion` carries the amounts
  through one redirect (Modules\Fees\Support\SuggestedScale), fills the
  fields, opens the block, and says which page and which scout year the
  figures came from — validating a number without knowing what it rests on
  is the thing this banner exists to prevent. The chef d'unité still has to
  click « Enregistrer le barème ».
#}
{% set _suggested = scale_suggestion|default(null) %}
<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body py-2">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm p-0 text-decoration-none"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fees-scale"
                aria-expanded="{{ _suggested ? 'true' : 'false' }}" aria-controls="fees-scale">
            <i class="bi bi-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i> Barème des cotisations
        </button>
        <div class="collapse mt-3{{ _suggested ? ' show' : '' }}" id="fees-scale">
            <p class="small text-body-secondary">
                Saisi à la main, uniquement pour traduire un écart en euros. Laissé vide, un écart s'affiche sans
                montant plutôt qu'avec un montant faux. La catégorie Desk n'est à préciser que si le site s'est
                trompé en la devinant.
            </p>
            {% if _suggested %}
                <div class="alert alert-info py-2 small" role="status">
                    Montants proposés pour l'année <strong>{{ _suggested.year }}</strong>, lus sur
                    <a href="{{ _suggested.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ _suggested.url }}</a>.
                    Rien n'est enregistré tant que vous n'avez pas cliqué sur « Enregistrer le barème ».
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            <form method="post" action="/admin/fees/tarifs/bareme">
                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                <div class="row g-3">
                    {% for key, line in tariff_panel %}
                        {% set _amount_cents = _suggested ? _suggested.amount_cents[key] : line.amount_cents %}
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                            <div class="border rounded p-2">
                                <p class="fw-semibold small mb-2">{{ category_labels[key] }}</p>
                                {% set _options = [{ value: '', label: '— Deviné par le site —', selected: line.fee_category_id is null }] %}
                                {% for category in fee_categories %}
                                    {% set _suffix = category.id == line.suggested_fee_category_id ? ' (deviné)' : '' %}
                                    {% set _options = _options|merge([{
                                        value: category.id,
                                        label: category.label ~ _suffix,
                                        selected: category.id == line.fee_category_id,
                                    }]) %}
                                {% endfor %}
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'fees-category-' ~ key,
                                    field_name: 'fee_category_' ~ key,
                                    label: 'Tarif Desk correspondant',
                                    type: 'select',
                                    options: _options,
                                    size: 'sm',
                                } only %}
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'fees-amount-' ~ key,
                                    field_name: 'amount_' ~ key,
                                    label: 'Montant par personne (€)',
                                    type: 'text',
                                    inputmode: 'decimal',
                                    value: _amount_cents is null ? '' : (_amount_cents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', ''),
                                    size: 'sm',
                                    wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
                {#
                  « Enregistrer le barème » stays the FIRST submit button of
                  the form on purpose: it is the one a browser fires when
                  someone presses Enter in an amount field, and a stray
                  Enter must never become an AI request.
                #}
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Enregistrer le barème</button>
                    {% if scale_lookup_available|default(false) %}
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                                formaction="/admin/fees/tarifs/bareme/chercher">
                            <i class="bi bi-magic" aria-hidden="true"></i> Chercher les montants
                        </button>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
                {% if scale_lookup_available|default(false) %}
                    <p class="form-text mt-2 mb-0">
                        « Chercher les montants » lit la page des cotisations de la fédération et pré-remplit les trois
                        champs ci-dessus, sans rien enregistrer. Vérifiez-les, puis enregistrez.
                    </p>
                {% endif %}
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
